  "prefLabel": "Env-Hw 1408.01 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Hw 1408.01 Applicability.\n\n(a) Except as provided in (b), below, this part shall apply to owners and operators of facilities that process used oil regulated under this chapter.\n\n(b) This part shall not apply to:\n\n(1) A used oil generator that performs the activities described in Env-Hw 1406.03;\n\n(2) A used oil transporter that conducts the activities specified in Env-Hw 1407.03(c); or\n\n(3) A used oil burner that conducts incidental processing operations during the normal course of used oil management prior to burning as provided in Env-Hw 1409.04.\n\nSource. #14282, eff 8-1-25, EXPIRES: 8-1-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-hw1400.html"
